source .venv/bin/activate
psql -d postgres
python run_pipeline.py
streamlit run app.py

Schedule (launchd, hourly + at login)
-------------------------------------
Job:  ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.mdtahsinsharif.ai-news-agent.plist
Logs: ~/Library/Logs/ai-news-agent/pipeline.log

Status:  launchctl print gui/$(id -u)/com.mdtahsinsharif.ai-news-agent
Run now: launchctl kickstart gui/$(id -u)/com.mdtahsinsharif.ai-news-agent
Stop:    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.mdtahsinsharif.ai-news-agent
Start:   launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.mdtahsinsharif.ai-news-agent.plist

Don't also run test_pipeline.py while the schedule is on: it loops
forever and would run the pipeline twice.
